@startuml
title Trinh tu them thuoc va lich uong
autonumber
actor "Nguoi cao tuoi" as User
participant "Web React" as Web
participant "Express API" as API
participant "authMiddleware" as Auth
participant "familyAccess" as Access
database "MongoDB / Mongoose" as DB
User -> Web: Nhap thong tin thuoc va lich
Web -> API: POST /api/v1/medications (Bearer token + JSON)
API -> Auth: Xac minh token
Auth --> API: UID nguoi dung
API -> Access: resolveOwnerAccess(req, manage=true)
Access --> API: ownerId hoac loi quyen
API -> API: Validate Zod va ngay bat dau/ket thuc
alt Du lieu khong hop le hoac khong du quyen
 API --> Web: Loi 400 / 403
 Web --> User: Hien thi loi
else Hop le
 API -> DB: Tao Medication
 loop Moi lich trong request
  API -> DB: Tao MedicationSchedule
  API -> DB: Tao ScheduleVersion v1
 end
 API -> DB: Ghi AuditLog action=create
 API --> Web: 201 + thuoc va lich
 Web --> User: Hien thi thuoc vua them
end
@enduml
